      "summaries": {
        "en": "DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B is a distilled reasoning model that makes advanced AI reasoning accessible on consumer hardware by compressing a larger model into a 1.5B parameter version. It employs reinforcement learning from human feedback (RLHF) to enhance logical consistency while maintaining conversational fluency. Developers can deploy it locally for applications requiring step-by-step reasoning, such as code explanation or educational tutoring, using the Hugging Face Transformers library with minimal setup.",
        "zh": "DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B 是一个通过知识蒸馏技术压缩得到的推理模型，将大型模型的复杂推理能力迁移到仅1.5B参数的轻量版本中，使普通硬件也能运行高级AI推理。其核心在于结合强化学习人类反馈（RLHF）优化逻辑一致性，同时保持对话流畅性，这种设计让模型在资源有限时仍能进行多步思考。开发者可通过Hugging Face Transformers库轻松部署，适用于需要逐步推理的场景，如代码解释、教育辅导或逻辑分析任务，为本地化AI应用提供了实用解决方案。",
        "es": "DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B is a distilled reasoning model that makes advanced AI reasoning accessible on consumer hardware by compressing a larger model into a 1.5B parameter version. It employs reinforcement learning from human feedback (RLHF) to enhance logical consistency while maintaining conversational fluency. Developers can deploy it locally for applications requiring step-by-step reasoning, such as code explanation or educational tutoring, using the Hugging Face Transformers library with minimal setup.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B stands out for transformers, safetensors, and qwen2 in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B is a distilled reasoning model that makes advanced AI reasoning accessible on consumer hardware by compressing a larger model into a 1.5B parameter version. It employs reinforcement learning from human feedback (RLHF) to enhance logical consistency while maintaining conversational fluency. Developers can deploy it locally for applications requiring step-by-step reasoning, such as code explanation or educational tutoring, using the Hugging Face Transformers library with minimal setup.",
          "how": "Review https://huggingface.co/deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
